{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Rift is a sci-fi visual novel where you follow your guide, Oni, to explore consciousness splitting in a multi-consciousness simulated world. This immersive journey lets you experience your consciousness scattering across different times and spaces through meaningful dialogue and choices that shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a concise story that\u2019s both profound and replayable. Through conversations with Oni, you\u2019ll shape the narrative and reflect on the nature of reality. The game encourages multiple playthroughs to uncover deeper meanings, providing endless room for imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the story with immersive choices and dialogue, revealing fragments of your consciousness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story with infinite replayability, sparking imagination and deeper reflection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Rift is perfect for fans of story-driven and philosophical games, blending everyday warmth with heartfelt farewells. Join Oni to challenge your perception of reality and embark on this unforgettable adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712020?t=1748021932","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712020?t=1748021932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712020/c9748f335ac9250d9bb2b101f6b1877545502ccb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748021932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712020/c9748f335ac9250d9bb2b101f6b1877545502ccb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748021932","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descript